#!name=Paperclip · Surge 签到合集（逐项开关）
#!desc=在模块编辑参数里将每个 Enable_* 设为 on/off。默认全部关闭，请只开启自己使用的签到。NodeSeek 保留你已有的独立模块。通过兼容运行器调用原作者脚本，未经过 Surge 实机验证。
#!author=MaYIHEI (原脚本), ChatGPT (Surge 适配)
#!homepage=https://github.com/MaYIHEI/paperclip
#!arguments=Enable_summary:off,Enable_weibotalk:off,Enable_tenvideo:off,Enable_mihoyo:off,Enable_newmixc:off,Enable_mishop:off,Enable_milottery:off,Enable_youpin:off,Enable_lhtj:off,Enable_qqmusic:off,Enable_qqmusic:off,Enable_qqmusic:off,Enable_wanda:off,Enable_tingtingfm:off,Enable_wps:off,Enable_camscanner:off,Enable_dreame:off,Enable_linghu:off,Enable_pan1:off,Enable_agentrouter:off,Enable_sgcc:off,Enable_cmcc:off,Enable_heybox:off,Enable_baidunetdisk:off,Enable_laifen:off,Enable_ppmt:off,Enable_tuhu:off,Enable_haidilao:off,Enable_huisheng:off,Enable_miniso:off,Enable_longde:off,Enable_lhtj:off,Enable_wedome:off,Enable_bhg:off,Enable_linli:off
#!arguments-desc=每项 Enable_脚本名 填 on 启用、off 关闭（默认）。签到汇总 Enable_summary 单独控制。修改后请在 Surge 中应用模块；Cookie 抓取由另一模块控制。

[Script]
签到汇总 = type=cron,cronexp="30 11 * * *",wake-system=true,script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/leoqyellow/leo/main/surge/paperclip-runner.js,argument="enabled={{{Enable_summary}}}&url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MaYIHEI/paperclip/refs/heads/main/app/summary/summary.js",timeout=180
